    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #357\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nConfirmed on origin at commit `145c79c` (working tree was already clean; nothing new to commit). Branch: `bb/relay-146-system-i18n-04-05-author-complete-czec-thr_kjm8riavfq`.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplements issue #146: complete Czech and English i18n catalogs for all system modules.\n\n- Added/extended `i18n/cs.json` + `i18n/en.json` beside every system module manifest: `chokePoint` (schemaCore), `views`, `seed` (systemDatabases, extended from Tasks-only to all 10 databases), `library`, `mail` (mailSync), `inbox` (inboxPipeline), and `docs` (empty catalogs, since the docs module declares no translatable content).\n- Every `database.<db>.name`, `property.<db>.<property>.name`, `property.<db>.<property>.option.<option>`, `viewType.<type>.name`, and `agentTool.<tool>.label` key each module owns now has both locales.\n- Pre-existing Czech labels (the Tasks catalog from #236) preserved verbatim — re-verified byte-for-byte after CI's code review flagged one key as unclear.\n- Wired all 7 modules' `i18n/` directories into `@semprec/data`'s build script so they ship in `dist/`.\n- Added `systemI18nCatalogCoverage.test.ts`, which enumerates every database/property/option/view-type/agent-tool key from the actual seeded state and fails if either locale is missing an entry.\n\nVerified: `format:check`, `lint`, `check:boundaries`, full monorepo build, `test:unit` (127 tests), `test:e2e` (5 tests), and `test:integration` (791 tests) all pass. AI code review: 0 open findings, 16/17 acceptance criteria met with the one \"unclear\" item confirmed correct.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
